Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?{\Yes?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:29.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This kind of lovey dovey event between lovey dovey lovers is something you'd see in a manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.65,0:00:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with this! I'm not happy at all. I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact, it's just scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said, say "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Aah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see that you're smiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, there's some rice on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You put it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:00.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take it off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, we're going on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... that's not what I mean.\NA date...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you... go on a date with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about... we go... on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, are you against it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... I'm not against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then go on a date with me, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it ultimately comes down to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any complaints... rather, any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then after school I'll make some excuse to go home early and get ready, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:02:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, come to my house once you're done preparing for the cultural festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}That's how today, June 13th, would come to be celebrated as the day I went on my first date with my girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.97,0:02:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or so I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I talked a bit too long with Sengoku\Nand Hanekawa at the school gates...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm a bit late...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're earlier than I expected.\NOh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, we're going.\NFollow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Araragi-kun?\NYou're pretty quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you understand the situation we're in right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:46.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When is "now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you spelling "situation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not where context comes from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend's father is with us on our first date...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't a date; it's torture.\NWhat exactly was I celebrating?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd be nervous, Araragi-kun, since this is our first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you won't make it at this rate. The night is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not nervous because this is my first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:22.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you... love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Answer me. Do you... love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:29.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this, you won't answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you don't love me, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. I love you too, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you... very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.51,0:05:42.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you really {\i1}are{\i0\fscx140} {\r}quiet.\NYou're being unusually taciturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Normally you chat with me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you're in a bad mood today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with my mood...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, so your head is sluggish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:05.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're taking advantage of my confusion to say whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, your jabs are always\Nenergetic, even when other things aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, then I'll be nice and give you a topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can just answer, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The parts I {\i1}don't{\i0\fscx140} {\r}like are obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NI was seriously looking forward to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dream? That's going overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.27,0:06:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you look up the words "Vain"\Nand "Person"... oh, what was it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara, seriously, what are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:51.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you be referring to me, or was that directed at Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father, Araragi-kun is addressing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hitagi-san! I was addressing Hitagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you won't use {\i1}my{\i0\fscx140} {\r}first name. Not that I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:11.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, Hitagi-san...\NI'm going to take the liberty of asking you again, but what are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:14.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not scheming anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}there's a famous mystery author by the name of Kuriowa Ruiko, but if you break up the characters in her name,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it becomes "Wicked Bad Child."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think that was intentional?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about something like that!\NWicked child and bad child are both referring to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:36.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure say cruel things in front of my parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.37,0:07:40.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father, it seems your child is a wicked child and a bad child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got quiet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I teased you a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you react so easily that I only want to depress you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those words just depressed me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what parts do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That you're nice,\Nyou're cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you come to my rescue, like a prince, whenever I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything I said before was my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:16.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of trash, I mean Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you about to call your boyfriend "trash" right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:24.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't accuse me of something I wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway Araragi-kun, how did you do on the last test?{\"ability test", same thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:36.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, I took care of you day and night at my house, just the two of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you intentionally say it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:43.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So? How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I scored better than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even got a better score in math, which was supposed to be my best subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to your help. Thank you, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:09:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father? It seems that Araragi-kun wants to thank you, so could you listen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you Hitagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.67,0:09:07.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would've been better if we could've gone over the answers right after the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, asking that much of you at\Nthis point is a bit too demanding, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though it's a little ironic to say this, since I was the one who tutored you, I'm a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:22.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, considering it's you, it wasn't very amusing or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't get tutored by you to get laughs, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}I was really looking forward to a situation like, "I studied so hard, but my scores were actually worse than usual!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In some ways, I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asking for something like that is much more demanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's really amazing. I compliment you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you might be able to do even {\i1}better{\i0}, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:58.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, it's fine with me if I tutor you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:03.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's...\Nthe best deal possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then every day from now on, you will come to my house for tutoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Every day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do smart people really study that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, obviously this program is designed for you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Smart people are smart before they even start studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like Hanekawa studies every day, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, the "studying" that Hanekawa-san does,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,unfortunately, is on a completely different level than our "studying."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:47.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san is the real thing. She's from a different world than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's not like Hanekawa always aces tests, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:11:00.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Hanekawa-san can't score 100, then the problem is with the test. I wonder what that's like, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I think about how much pressure that must be, I can't honestly say that I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:12.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pressure, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:13.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stress, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, since you're crawling at rock bottom and can't even imagine those really smart people, Araragi-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:24.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're just going to have to put in\Nmore and more effort, then try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, from now on, every day, there will be tutoring at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Kanbaru's house would be fine too, once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does Kanbaru have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to play with her a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promised her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:46.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you'd want to play with Kanbaru too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, she's an interesting person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, about Kanbaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:56.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why's she so erotic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Erotic? Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}Even {\i1}Oshino{\i0\fscx140} {\r\fscx90}seemed to recognize her as an erotic person rather than as an athletic person when I talked to him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it only seems like that from a male's point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just true to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:27.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Personally, I can't overlook the fact that my cute junior is being given a label like "erotic."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you going to do if you can't overlook it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"What will I do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll warp the basis for your decision, the very foundation of your values.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then Kanbaru will actually appear to be an innocent, pure-hearted girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sto—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and, that just about does it, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever you want, Hitagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:28.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:32.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, wait here for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead alone and prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prepare for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a chat with Father or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.21,0:13:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I'm Araragi Koyomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Take good care of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.60,0:14:13.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you might have heard, but I'm the model businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have hardly any time to spend with Hitagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this might not mean much, but it's been a long time since I've seen Hitagi having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've already heard about Hitagi's mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And about Hitagi's condition too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not the only reason, and of course it's in no small part my fault for having prioritized my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but Hitagi closed her heart to others long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:15:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though recently, for the first time in a while, in a long while, Hitagi has asked me for favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to let her help with my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now this. Both times, you were involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:14.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you're quite something, Araragi-kun, to be able to change her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems you think very highly of me, and I'm honored, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it was all coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:25.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that you had a hand in curing Hitagi of her condition, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't think it was necessarily me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, Hitagi-san saved herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just there to see her through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:49.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More than anything else, I am thankful that you were there for her when she needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a failure as a father. I wasn't there when she needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, even though I'm a failure of a father, I'm quite proud of my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:08.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I trust her judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're the man that she chose, then there's no argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take good care of my daughter, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:18.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Father, from here on it'll just be us young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for driving us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be back in about two hours,\Nso please go ahead and work until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:53.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara, how much longer are we going to walk like th—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't look up yet, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing, I seriously can't put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you have poor vocabulary skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's Deneb, Altair, Vega.\NThe famous Summer Triangle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From there, pan to the side, and that\Narea is Ophiuchus, the "snake-holder."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Serpentis would be the stars lined up around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That remarkably bright one over there is Spica, so that area is Virgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there is Cancer, well, I guess it's a little hard to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything that I have, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The opportunity to tutor you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:05.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a cute junior, a clumsy father,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and this starry sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are the only things I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only things I can give you, Araragi-kun, are things like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:21.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, technically, I also have my insults and verbal assaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, there's this thing called my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you not want that, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.97,0:19:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, I was almost violated by a perverted man, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah... yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:50.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm scared of doing what\Nthat pervert tried to do to me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm really afraid... of disliking you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm afraid... of losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:13.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I can't say my life up until now was fortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if I got your attention because I was so unfortunate, then I think it was okay, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how hard I've fallen for you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, I'll make something come of it, no matter what. So... I want you to wait just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:38.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, at this point in time, out of everything I can give to you, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:42.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for now... this starry sky is the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I came here when I was a child; my father, my mother... and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey Araragi-kun, do you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you too, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which parts about me do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like everything about you. There's nothing I don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about you? Which parts do you like about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.49,0:21:29.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That you're nice, you're cute, and you come to my rescue, like a prince, whenever I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:44.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, since that pervert was only after my body, he didn't even try to take my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, Araragi-kun,\Nwe're going to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could... could you... kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:02.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How... how about... we kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's kiss, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.37,0:22:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it ultimately comes down to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.17,0:22:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how today became a day to be celebrated...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:22.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:23:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Karen, you said you do Karate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.52,0:24:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't karate and café latte similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just about as similar as chiropractics and plastic hand warmers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.20,0:24:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are! They're even more similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.74,0:24:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're related?\NPossibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.66,0:24:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.33,0:24:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview Quiz!\NQuiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.87,0:24:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't quiz similar to cream cheese?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just about as similar as beef stew and a meat hot pot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.71,0:24:19.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.79,0:24:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Tsubasa Cat part three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.75,0:24:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't part three and Somo-san similar?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:25.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are!
